        "raw_markdown": "yes this competition is about post training and not harness engineering. no matter the setup you try the competition model has a output distribution that cannot be changed much. the harness itself is limiting the expressiveness of the model on top of it.\n\nsome of the ablations that I had shared as discussion posts hint towards the same.",
        "content": "<p>yes this competition is about post training and not harness engineering. no matter the setup you try the competition model has a output distribution that cannot be changed much. the harness itself is limiting the expressiveness of the model on top of it.</p>\n<p>some of the ablations that I had shared as discussion posts hint towards the same.</p>",
